              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Islemen Warriors have hand weapon, double handed weapon and heavy armour. They may exchange double handed weapon for thrusting spear and shield (free). They are Veteran and Stubborn.</characteristic>
